  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n* 16455228e50c2e30d7bc987108af54b252e260af Rename simulation journeys to episodes. (#2034)\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n**GenAI simulations: `journeys` renamed to `episodes`** (matches the GenAI API)\r\nThe `doctl evaluation simulation-run` subcommands were renamed. The old command\r\nnames have been **removed** — scripts using them will fail with \"unknown command\".\r\n| Old                                       | New                                        |\r\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\r\n| `simulation-run list-journeys <run-uuid>` | `simulation-run list-episodes <run-uuid>`  |\r\n| `simulation-run get-journey <run> <id>`   | `simulation-run get-episode <run> <id>`    |\r\n- `get-trajectory` / `get-trajectory-url` keep their names; their second argument\r\n  is now `<episode-uuid>` (was `<journey-uuid>`).\r\n- Short aliases `ls-j` and `g-j` continue to work.\r\n- JSON output (`-o json`) field names changed: `total_journeys` → `total_episodes`,\r\n  `journeys_finished` → `episodes_finished`, `journey_uuid` → `episode_uuid`,\r\n  `journey_index` → `episode_index`.\r\n\r\n"
